<title>INDIA: Bank of India up 8 pct on BSE.</title>
<headline>Bank of India up 8 pct on BSE.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Indian state-run, Bank of India rose 5.25 rupees, or 8.4 percent, to 67.75 at the Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) on Monday as the stock entered a no-delivery period, traders said.</p>
<p>Over one million shares of Bank of India were traded by early afternoon at the BSE.</p>
